  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Cuando solo quedan reyes y peones, todo gira en torno a la "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "promotion",
            "text": "coronación"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Un "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "passed-pawn",
            "text": "peón pasado"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " es el que ya no tiene peones rivales delante ni en las "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "columnas"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " de al lado: nada lo frena salvo las piezas. Para saber si tu rey alcanza un peón pasado rival, usa la "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rule-of-the-square",
            "text": "regla del cuadrado"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": imagina el cuadrado que va del peón a su "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "queening-square",
            "text": "casilla de coronación"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", aquí el marcado. Si tu rey puede entrar en él en su turno, alcanza al peón."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "When only kings and pawns are left, everything turns on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "promotion",
            "text": "promotion"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". A "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "passed-pawn",
            "text": "passed pawn"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " is one with no rival pawns in front of it or on the "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "files"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " next to it: nothing stops it except the pieces. To tell whether your king catches a rival passed pawn, use the "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rule-of-the-square",
            "text": "rule of the square"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": picture the square running from the pawn to its "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "queening-square",
            "text": "queening square"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", the marked one here. If your king can step into it on its turn, it catches the pawn."
          }
        ]
      },
